      "id": "claim_ebac1da0f3074311a85163ee5c73cd2a",
      "statement": "MRM-POL-02 defines End-User Analytics (EUAs) as simple descriptive calculations (counts, medians, percentages over historical data with no forward-looking estimation), requiring only Archer registration and business-owner attestation (~2 weeks), versus Tier 2 customer-facing estimates (forward-looking values shown to clients) which require independent validation (10-14 weeks typical, 160-240 validator hours); the inventory already lists a comparable registered EUA, EUA-TRS-0007 (Ops corridor completion dashboard), while client_wire_history_features itself has no MRM registration of any kind.",
